\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Quantum state tomography and circular-iris entanglement preservation. (a) Passive $M = 5$ Gouy-diverse IC-POVM radial-qudit tomography ($d = 4, l = 1, w/w_0 = 0.25$, full rank $16/16$ versus $7/16$ at $M = 1$, $\kappa (\mathcal  {S}_{\mathrm  {POVM}}) = 442.5$): $30$-trial $R\hat  {\rho }R$ MLE MSE (Table~\ref {tab:povm_mle}) tracks the single-photon CRB $41.80/N_{\mathrm  {phot}}$ alongside sequential $5$-MUB tomography ($18.75/N_{\mathrm  {phot}}$). (b) Post-selected SPDC Bell--CHSH parameter $S(R_{\mathrm  {iris}}/R_0)$ [Eq.~\eqref  {eq:iris_chsh}] for $| \Psi  \rangle  = (| 1,-1 \rangle +| 4,-4 \rangle )/\sqrt  {2}$ ($w = 0.1\,R_0$, LG $w_0 = \sqrt  {2}\,R_0$); inset compares single-mode transmissions $t_{1..4}(R_0)$.}}{6}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:quantum_utility}{{3}{6}{Quantum state tomography and circular-iris entanglement preservation. (a) Passive $M = 5$ Gouy-diverse IC-POVM radial-qudit tomography ($d = 4, l = 1, w/w_0 = 0.25$, full rank $16/16$ versus $7/16$ at $M = 1$, $\kappa (\mathcal {S}_{\mathrm {POVM}}) = 442.5$): $30$-trial $R\hat {\rho }R$ MLE MSE (Table~\ref {tab:povm_mle}) tracks the single-photon CRB $41.80/N_{\mathrm {phot}}$ alongside sequential $5$-MUB tomography ($18.75/N_{\mathrm {phot}}$). (b) Post-selected SPDC Bell--CHSH parameter $S(R_{\mathrm {iris}}/R_0)$ [Eq.~\eqref {eq:iris_chsh}] for $\ket {\Psi } = (\ket {1,-1}+\ket {4,-4})/\sqrt {2}$ ($w = 0.1\,R_0$, LG $w_0 = \sqrt {2}\,R_0$); inset compares single-mode transmissions $t_{1..4}(R_0)$}{figure.3}{}}
